-- which controls carry a number --
  cortado has this many kinds: 27
  every kind this platform builds was asked: true
  exactly the kinds that carry one take a low end, a high end and a value: true
  this many kinds carry one: 4
  each reads its range back unchanged: true
  each reads the value that was written: true
-- moving one --
  this many of them a user can move: 2
  each raises value_changed exactly where a user can move it: true
  and none raises anything when the program writes to it: true
-- the increment --
  exactly the kinds that have one take it, or say the platform cannot: true
  zero means continuous to a slider and is out of range to a stepper: true
  and only a stepper reads it back: true
drove=true
